@host = https://localhost:55076

### Forberedelse: opret elev uden interesser — forventet 201 (anden gang 400, fordi brugernavnet findes)
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "standardtest",
  "password": "hemmelig1",
  "parentEmail": "test@example.com",
  "grade": 8,
  "interestIds": []
}

### Forberedelse: log ind som eleven uden interesser — forventet 200 + token
# @name loginStandard
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "standardtest", "password": "hemmelig1" }

### AK3.2 Elev uden interesse får standard-øvesæt — forventet 201, "Øvesæt 1, Brøker, Standard"
# @name start
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-set-attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStandard.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "topicId": 1 }

### AK5.1 Rigtigt svar — forventet 204
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-set-attempts/{{start.response.body.$.attemptId}}/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStandard.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "exerciseId": {{start.response.body.$.exercises[0].id}}, "answer": "15" }

### Samme opgave igen (note under UC5: kun ét svar pr. opgave) — forventet 409
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-set-attempts/{{start.response.body.$.attemptId}}/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStandard.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "exerciseId": {{start.response.body.$.exercises[0].id}}, "answer": "15" }

### AK6.1 Afslut — forventet 204
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-set-attempts/{{start.response.body.$.attemptId}}/completion
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStandard.response.body.$.token}}

### AK6.2 Afslut igen — forventet 409
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-set-attempts/{{start.response.body.$.attemptId}}/completion
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStandard.response.body.$.token}}

### AK6.3 Svar efter afslut — forventet 409
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-set-attempts/{{start.response.body.$.attemptId}}/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStandard.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "exerciseId": {{start.response.body.$.exercises[1].id}}, "answer": "320" }

### Forberedelse: opret en anden elev — forventet 201 (anden gang 400, fordi brugernavnet findes)
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "andenelev",
  "password": "hemmelig1",
  "parentEmail": "test@example.com",
  "grade": 8,
  "interestIds": [1]
}

### Forberedelse: log ind som en anden elev — forventet 200 + token
# @name loginOther
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "andenelev", "password": "hemmelig1" }

### En andens forsøg — forventet 404
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-set-attempts/{{start.response.body.$.attemptId}}/completion
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOther.response.body.$.token}}

### Uden login — forventet 401
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-set-attempts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "topicId": 1 }